## 13. Emoji Test

😀 😎 🚀 🔥 💻 🎯 🧠

---

## 14. Escaping Characters

\*Not italic\*  
\# Not a heading  
\`Not code\`

---

## 15. Nested Mixed Content

1. Item with code:
   ```js
   const x = 42;
   ```
2. Item with table:

   | A | B |
   |---|---|
   | 1 | 2 |

3. Item with quote:

   > Nested inside list

