# 🎯 End of Markdown Stress Test

If everything renders correctly:

✅ Headings  
✅ Code highlighting  
✅ Tables aligned  
✅ HTML rendered  
✅ Footnotes working  
✅ Math parsed  

Then your Markdown viewer is solid.